  "title": "对《红旗》杂志一九六七年第十二期社论的批语",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-337.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>337)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　还我长城。<br>\n<br>\n　　（注：这篇题为《向人民的主要敌人猛烈开火》的社论，是由林杰起草，王力、关锋批准发表的。社论中错误地提出了“军内一小撮”的口号，从而转移了斗争大方向，主席立即提出了严厉的批评。）<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-336.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-338.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
